  "privacyFooter": "Review how data is sent, stored, and deleted.",
  "privacyRecipients": "Recipients, data, and purposes",
  "privacyRecipientsBody": "• OpenStreetMap Overpass API (overpass-api.de, Kumi Systems, Mail.ru): your location, search radius, and route IDs, to fetch routes and stops. Sent only with your consent.\n• Map tiles (OpenStreetMap, OSM France): the visible map area, to draw the map.\n• Google Maps (only with an API key and the setting on): the visible map area, to draw the map.\n• Place search (Nominatim, Photon): the text you search and a nearby coordinate to rank results, to find destinations.\n• App Store / Google Play: purchasing and restoring PREMIUM.\nBus checks and the number table are computed on your device only. Nothing is sent to Google.",
  "privacyStorage": "Storage on your device",
  "privacyStorageBody": "Route data, its archive, the destination, destination history, saved places, and settings are stored on this device. Route data is also saved to your own iCloud Drive only when iCloud sync is on.",
